----------

Precisely.  I often wrap subscript expressions in naF(), where

naF <- function(x) {
        x <- as.logical(x)
        x[is.na(x)] <- FALSE
        x
}

Thus

> tst[naF(tst$x==1),]
  x a y 
1 1 a 1

